      'Lift the poached thighs out to a cutting board or wide, shallow bowl with tongs to shred rather than working the forks against the meat inside the pot — you can feel exactly where the fibers separate cleanly in a shallow dish, which is much harder to judge one-handed against a pot wall with hot broth sloshing around.',
