        q: 'Can I use chicken breast instead of thighs for a leaner version?',
        a: 'You can, but pull it at 165°F rather than the thigh\'s 175-180°F target — breast has far less internal fat and connective tissue to buffer it against overcooking, so holding it to the thigh\'s higher temperature will dry it out and make it harder to shred cleanly.',
