    verificationBasis: 'USDA FSIS 145°F safe minimum for whole beef cuts; 125°F pull for chef-standard medium-rare per Serious Eats\' Food Lab tenderloin testing and Cook\'s Illustrated grilled-filet method. Two-zone sear-then-indirect approach from Meathead Goldwyn\'s reverse-sear guide on AmazingRibs.com.',
