        q: 'Can I add strips to the pan in two batches instead of laying all of them in at once?',
        a: 'Not with this method — the point of the cold start is that pan and bacon warm up together, so dropping a fresh cold strip in partway through would cool the pan right where the earlier strips have already built up a fat pool, throwing off timing for everything already cooking.',
