    cutOrPrep: '3 lb mixed apples (a McIntosh/Gala or Fuji/Honeycrisp blend for balanced sweet-tart body), peeled, cored, and cut into 1-inch chunks; 1/2 cup water, 1 tbsp lemon juice, 2 tbsp brown sugar (optional), 1/2 tsp cinnamon',
    state: 'fresh',
