    flipAtMinutes: 0,
    restMinutes: 5,
    donenessCue: 'The apples have collapsed into a rough pulp with pockets of intact chunk still visible; a wooden spoon dragged through the pot leaves a channel that holds its shape for 2–3 seconds before slowly filling; the liquid on the bottom has thickened to a light syrup.',
