    cutOrPrep: '4 boneless skinless chicken breasts (6–7 oz each), butterflied and pounded to 1/2-inch, seasoned with salt/pepper/garlic powder/dried oregano; seared in 2 tbsp olive oil in a 12-inch oven-safe skillet, then simmered with 2 cups marinara, topped with 8 oz shredded low-moisture mozzarella and 1/2 cup grated parmesan, covered with a lid to melt the cheese on the stovetop (no oven step)',
    state: 'fresh',
    tempF: 400,
    tempC: 204,
    tempFormatted: 'Medium-high sear (400°F surface) then medium simmer (205°F sauce) covered for cheese melt',
    timeMinMinutes: 20,
