    donenessCue: 'The dough edge visible above the cheese is deep golden and pulls slightly from the skillet wall; the tomato on top is bubbling in slow, viscous pops rather than watery jumps; the underside of the crust reads brittle-crisp when checked with a metal spatula at the edge.',
