    keywords: ['cast iron french toast time', 'how to cook french toast in cast iron skillet', 'cast iron french toast temp'],
    metaDescription: 'How long to cook French toast in cast iron: 350°F (177°C) for 6–8 mins to 160°F (71°C). Custard set with golden butter crust.',
