        q: 'Can I use chicken thighs instead of breast for this?',
        a: 'Yes, and thighs are more forgiving at this heat since their extra intramuscular fat resists drying out, but they\'re denser than breast at the same thickness, so judge doneness by the strip going opaque and firm at 165°F rather than by matching the breast\'s timing exactly.',
