        q: 'What\'s the actual difference between outside skirt and inside skirt for this method?',
        a: 'Outside skirt is thicker, more uniform, and generally more tender than inside skirt, which runs thinner and more irregular in shape. The timing here assumes outside skirt; inside skirt will cook faster, so check earlier than the stated range if that\'s what you have.',
