        q: 'Can I use the point instead of the flat for this?',
        a: 'Yes, though the point carries more fat and connective tissue and behaves more forgivingly over long cooks; it will render differently than the leaner, more uniform flat this datasheet is written for, so treat the 203°F probe-feel target as the real guide rather than the flat\'s stated time range.',
